# This deployment runs on MySQL/MariaDB, never on SQLite.
#
# better-sqlite3 is the zero-config fallback for a local machine and is
# declared as an optional dependency. It is a native module with no
# prebuilt binary for Node 26, so without this line npm spends two
# minutes trying to compile it against a V8 API it does not support,
# and the build fails even though the server never loads it.
#
# Skipping optional dependencies makes the install fast and
# deterministic. To work on SQLite locally: npm i better-sqlite3
omit=optional
